ly good relationship with each other. The guy annoys the girl with his affection and silly antics while she deals with it.\n\nI want the two characters to go on a date with each other. Something cute and light-hearted if possible! \n\nPossible scenarios: The couple are shopping and the guy is forced to carry all of the girl's bags. \nThe guy eats out of the girl's hands, like ice cream, parfait, or a crepe and it surprises her. \nOr he could surprise the girl by kissing her on the cheek! \n\nWhichever seems to spark your interest! \n\nPose & Expression: Up to you!\n\nDate Clothes ( some inspiration here ) : https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1z_d04ulel2UExEsacoPkWJhmIqDboqlm?usp=sharing\n\nMale Reference ( their height difference is also here ) : https://imgur.com/a/HsYsbgz\n\nThank you for considering me!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/10961324.seiza-marebito/gallery", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@fugutakut/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3967a45a/uploads/origins/d5549205-11e8-46f1-85f4-9148aa87149a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c93a95f689fb29f8d6675af296da54f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3967a45a/uploads/origins/d5549205-11e8-46f1-85f4-9148aa87149a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1c93a95f689fb29f8d6675af296da54f, https://si.imgix.net/3967a45a/uploads/origins/d5549205-11e8-46f1-85f4-9148aa87149a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=bf737adba581f0ec4b74a94db7b05e2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3967a45a/uploads/origins/d5549205-11e8-46f1-85f4-9148aa87149a?bg=%2